&lt;a href="United%20Nations"&gt;United Nations&lt;/a&gt; Fund for International Partnerships (UNFIP) diadegaké sasi Maret 1998 déning &lt;a href="Sekretaris%20Jenderal%20PBB"&gt;Sekretaris Jenderal PBB&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kofi%20Annan"&gt;Kofi Annan&lt;/a&gt;. UNFIP tanggungjawab marang pangaturan lan pangembangan &lt;a href="kerjasama"&gt;kerjasama&lt;/a&gt; ing antara &lt;a href="Daftar%20badan%20khusus%20Perserikatan%20Bangsa-Bangsa"&gt;badan&lt;/a&gt;, departemen, lan program lan &lt;a href="sektor%20pribadi"&gt;sektor pribadi&lt;/a&gt; PBB. UNFIP nyambut gawé karo yayasan lan parusahan kang njurung PBB kanggo golèk kasempatan kerjasama lan &lt;a href="kolaborasi"&gt;kolaborasi&lt;/a&gt;.
UNFIP dibawahi Direktur Eksekutif Robert Skinner lan dipantau déning siji Dhéwan Penasihat kang dibawahi &lt;a href="Deputi%20Sekretaris%20Jenderal%20PBB"&gt;Deputi Sekretaris Jenderal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Amina%20J.%20Mohammed"&gt;Amina J. Mohammed&lt;/a&gt;. Kantor pusaté dumunung ing &lt;a href="United%20Nations%20Headquarters"&gt;United Nations Headquarters&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;.
UNFIP iku komponen saka &lt;a href="United%20Nations%20Office%20for%20Partnerships"&gt;United Nations Office for Partnerships&lt;/a&gt;, kang uga mbawahi &lt;a href="United%20Nations%20Democracy%20Fund"&gt;UN Democracy Fund&lt;/a&gt;.
