<doc id="47383" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=47383" title="Daftar Juwara Donya Pembalap Formula Siji">
Daftar Juwara Donya Pembalap Formula Siji

Juwara donya &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji"&gt;Formula Siji&lt;/a&gt; sing sepisanan ya iku &lt;a href="Nino%20Farina"&gt;Nino Farina&lt;/a&gt;. Kajuwaraan donya pembalap F1 dianakaké kanggo sepisanan ya iku &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt;. Pembalap pisanan sing dadi juwara donya kanthi maturut-turut ya iku &lt;a href="Alberto%20Ascari"&gt;Alberto Ascari&lt;/a&gt;, sing dadi juwara donya ing &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201952"&gt;mangsa 1952&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201953"&gt;1953&lt;/a&gt;.
FIA kanthi resmi ora nyatakaké juwara marang sawijining pembalap nganti pungkasan mangsa, nanging sawijining pembalap dinyatakaké kanthi "de facto" juwara donya nalika ora ana pembalap sing mampu nyaingi skor-é, sanadyan yèn éntuk aji penuh sajeroning sisa kompetisi. Kajuwaraan donya pembalap wis mengalami bab iki kaping 23 saka total 56 mangsa sing ana. Mangsa kompetisi sing duwé juwara donya paling awal kadadéan ing &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202002"&gt;mangsa 2002&lt;/a&gt;, nalika &lt;a href="Michael%20Schumacher"&gt;Michael Schumacher&lt;/a&gt; ngamanaké gelar juwara donya sanadyan isih kasisa enem seri balapan.
<h2>Miturut mangsa</h2>
<h2>Berdasarkan pembalap</h2>
<h2>Miturut kabangsan</h2>
<h2>Rekor</h2>
<ul>
<li>Juwara donya paling anom: &lt;a href="Lewis%20Hamilton"&gt;Lewis Hamilton&lt;/a&gt; - pada umur 23 taun, 9 bulan, 26 hari (&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Juwara donya tuwa dhéwé: &lt;a href="Juan%20Manuel%20Fangio"&gt;Juan Manuel Fangio&lt;/a&gt; - pada umur 46 taun, 41 hari (&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201957"&gt;1957&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Juwara donya paling akèh: &lt;a href="Michael%20Schumacher"&gt;Michael Schumacher&lt;/a&gt; - 7 (&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%201995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Juwara donya maturut-turut paling akèh: &lt;a href="Michael%20Schumacher"&gt;Michael Schumacher&lt;/a&gt; - 5 (&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Formula%20Siji%20mangsa%202004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
