<doc id="48123" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=48123" title="Abu Hanifah">
Abu Hanifah

Nu’man bin Tsabit bin Zuta bin Mahan at-Taymi (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: النعمان بن ثابت‎‎), luwing kondhang kanthi sebutan Abu&amp;nbsp;Hanifah, (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: بو حنيفة‎‎) (miyos ing &lt;a href="Kufah"&gt;Kufah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Irak"&gt;Irak&lt;/a&gt;, 80 &lt;a href="Hijriyah"&gt;H&lt;/a&gt; / 699 &lt;a href="Masehi"&gt;M&lt;/a&gt; — séda ing &lt;a href="Baghdad"&gt;Baghdad&lt;/a&gt;, Irak, 148 &lt;a href="Hijriyah"&gt;H&lt;/a&gt; / 767 &lt;a href="Masehi"&gt;M&lt;/a&gt;) minangka tokoh sing madeg &lt;a href="Madahab"&gt;Madahab&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fiqih"&gt;Yurisprudensi Islam&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hanafi"&gt;Hanafi&lt;/a&gt;.
Abu Hanifah uga minangka sawijining &lt;a href="Tabi%27in"&gt;Tabi'in&lt;/a&gt; (génerasi langsung sawisé Sahabat Nabi) amarga naté sapatemon karo &lt;a href="Anas%20bin%20Malik"&gt;Anas bin Malik&lt;/a&gt; (sahabat Muhammad) lan ngriwayataké hadits saka Anas lan sahabat liyané.
Imam Hanafi mau tokoh pisanan sing nyusun kitab fiqih alandhesan kategorisasi, umpamané kasucèn (thoharoh), &lt;a href="salat"&gt;sholat&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyané. Kategorisasi iki banjur ditiru déning ulama-ulama sing ana sabanjuré, kaya ta &lt;a href="Malik%20bin%20Anas"&gt;Malik bin Anas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Imam%20Syafi%27i"&gt;Imam Syafi'i&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abu%20Dawud"&gt;Abu Dawud&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Imam%20Bukhari"&gt;Bukhari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Imam%20Muslim"&gt;Muslim&lt;/a&gt; lan liya-liyané.
